# Data Directory

This directory contains the datasets, schemas, and preprocessed data files required for training, evaluating, and testing the ML pipeline for the Amazon ML Challenge problem statement.

---

## 📂 Directory Structure

```text
data/
├── raw/                      # Original, unmodified datasets
│   ├── train.csv             # Training data containing features and ground truth labels
│   ├── test.csv              # Test dataset for generating final predictions
│   └── sample_submission.csv # Expected format for final submission
├── processed/                # Cleaned, tokenized, or feature-engineered data
│   ├── train_cleaned.csv     # Preprocessed training dataset
│   └── test_cleaned.csv      # Preprocessed testing dataset
├── embeddings/               # Precomputed text or image feature embeddings
└── README.md                 # Documentation for data directory




student_resource/
│
├── dataset/
│   ├── train/
│   │   ├── train_source1.tsv
│   │   ├── train_source2.tsv
│   │   ├── train_source3.tsv
│   │   └── train_ground_truth.tsv
│   │
│   └── test/
│       ├── test_source1.tsv
│       ├── test_source2.tsv
│       └── test_source3.tsv
